{"ticker":"DASH","updated":"2026-10-30T22:43:19Z","profile":{"longName":"DoorDash, Inc.","shortName":"DoorDash, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Internet Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.doordash.com","fullTimeEmployees":31400,"marketCap":77555998720,"trailingPE":94.20527,"forwardPE":22.125832,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.545806,"pegRatio":0.81,"targetMeanPrice":256.184,"targetHighPrice":350.0,"targetLowPrice":172.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":40,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.34,"earningsGrowth":0.919,"grossMargins":0.52669996,"operatingMargins":0.095970005,"profitMargins":0.06231,"totalRevenue":17061000192,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":260.74,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":143.3,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"DoorDash, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates a commerce platform that connects merchants, consumers, and dashers in the United States and internationally. The company operates DoorDash Marketplace, Wolt Marketplace, and Deliveroo Marketplace, which provide various services, such as customer acquisition, demand generation, order fulfillment, merchandising, payment processing, and customer support. It also offers consumer membership programs, DashPass, Wolt+, and Deliveroo Plus; advertising as a value-added service through its marketplaces; and white-label delivery fulfillment services, as well as services that help merchants establish online ordering, build branded mobile apps, manage reservations and in-store dining, manage consumer relationships, enable tableside order and pay, and improve customer support. The company was formerly known as Palo Alto Delivery Inc. and changed its name to DoorDash, Inc. in 2015. DoorDash, Inc. was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"DoorDash, Inc. 及其子公司經營一個商業平台，將美國和國際上的商家、消費者和達人聯繫起來。該公司經營 DoorDash Marketplace、Wolt Marketplace 和 Deliveroo Marketplace，提供各種服務，例如客戶獲取、需求產生、訂單履行、推銷、支付處理和客戶支援。它還提供消費者會員計劃、DashPass、Wolt+ 和 Deliveroo Plus；透過其市場將廣告作為增值服務；和白標交付履行服務，以及幫助商家建立線上訂購、建立品牌行動應用程式、管理預訂和店內用餐、管理消費者關係、支援桌邊訂單和支付以及改善客戶支援的服務。該公司前身為 Palo Alto Delivery Inc.，於 2015 年更名為 DoorDash, Inc.。 DoorDash, Inc. 成立於 2013 年，總部位於加州舊金山。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"網路零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":240.89,"h":244.74,"l":238.2,"c":244.1,"v":2683900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":244.045,"h":254.1,"l":243.065,"c":248.83,"v":3541400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":248.83,"h":250.7,"l":244.26,"c":248.78,"v":2507100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":249.715,"h":251.49,"l":243.55,"c":246.85,"v":2195800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":249.4,"h":254.96,"l":248.299,"c":250.6,"v":3333600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":252.09,"h":257.105,"l":249.78,"c":256.53,"v":3042800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":257.57,"h":258.8,"l":252.55,"c":257.43,"v":4631000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":258.82,"h":262.48,"l":258.22,"c":260.19,"v":2357200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":259.04,"h":261.43,"l":255.465,"c":257.98,"v":2215900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":257.77,"h":260.56,"l":256.29,"c":258.09,"v":2592400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":257.94,"h":263.43,"l":257.23,"c":263.09,"v":2926600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":263.07,"h":266.37,"l":253.86,"c":259.25,"v":3197300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":258.92,"h":268.29,"l":258.15,"c":268.07,"v":3058700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":268.58,"h":269.06,"l":264.0,"c":265.29,"v":10684200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":264.52,"h":266.56,"l":262.42,"c":262.75,"v":2952200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":261.92,"h":267.77,"l":261.0,"c":265.75,"v":2248800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":266.16,"h":268.58,"l":259.705,"c":260.74,"v":3148100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":258.485,"h":263.76,"l":257.5,"c":262.08,"v":1886500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":263.44,"h":264.2,"l":259.363,"c":262.47,"v":1603200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":267.67,"h":272.64,"l":267.0,"c":272.5,"v":3546300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":273.56,"h":275.51,"l":266.0,"c":271.99,"v":3245300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":269.5,"h":271.39,"l":265.2,"c":267.64,"v":2500800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":268.9,"h":270.435,"l":260.15,"c":270.09,