789/000179278926000013/dash-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our mission is to grow and empower local economies. We aim to do this by providing services that reduce friction in local commerce and help merchants better connect with consumers in their communities. Our primary offerings include the DoorDash Marketplace, the Wolt Marketplace, and the Deliveroo Marketplace (our \"Marketplaces\"), and our Commerce Platform.","zh":"我們的使命是發展和增強當地經濟。我們的目標是透過提供減少當地商業摩擦並幫助商家更好地與社區消費者建立聯繫的服務來實現這一目標。我們的主要產品包括 DoorDash Marketplace、Wolt Marketplace 和 Deliveroo Marketplace（我們的「市場」）以及我們的商務平台。"},{"en":"Our Marketplaces operate in over 40 countries, including the United States, and account for the vast majority of our revenue today. Our Marketplaces serve three primary constituents: merchants, consumers, and Dashers1.","zh":"我們的市場在包括美國在內的 40 多個國家/地區開展業務，占我們當今收入的絕大多數。我們的市場為三個主要組成部分提供服務：商家、消費者和 Dasher1。"},{"en":"Our Marketplaces provide an integrated suite of services that help merchants establish an online presence, connect with consumers in their communities, and solve mission-critical challenges, such as customer acquisition, demand generation, order fulfillment, merchandising, payment processing, and customer support. We typically earn a fee from merchants for the services we provide based on the size of each transaction. We also offer advertising as a value-added service through our Marketplaces to help merchants and consumer packaged goods companies increase consumer engagement and drive incremental revenue.","zh":"我們的市場提供一套整合的服務，幫助商家建立線上形象，與社群中的消費者建立聯繫，並解決關鍵任務挑戰，例如客戶獲取、需求產生、訂單履行、推銷、支付處理和客戶支援。我們通常根據每筆交易的規模向商家收取我們提供的服務的費用。我們也透過市場提供廣告作為增值服務，幫助商家和消費品公司提高消費者參與度並增加收入。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The markets in which we operate are intensely competitive and characterized by shifting user preferences, fragmentation, and frequent introductions of new services and offerings. We compete for our constituencies on the following criteria:","zh":"我們經營的市場競爭激烈，其特點是用戶偏好不斷變化、分散化以及頻繁推出新服務和產品。我們根據以下標準爭奪選區："},{"en":"Merchants. We compete for merchants based on our ability to generate consumer demand and the quality of our business enablement and demand fulfillment services.","zh":"商人。我們根據產生消費者需求的能力以及業務支援和需求滿足服務的品質來爭取商家。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":11460000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2257000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":13717000000}},"peers":["ABNB","SNOW","AFRM","LYFT","RBLX"]}}